Nothing satisfies a crowd like a buffet, and at The[ Rid]geline, we have buffet catering options to suit every palate. Our breakfast buffets run the gamut from The Continental, featuring assorted danishes, turnovers, muffins, and fresh fruit, to the deluxe[ Big] Thompson, which includes pancakes, French toast, ham[ ste]aks, and more. Lunch buffet options cover an array of cuisine from around the globe, ranging from the Orient Express to the Taste of Italy to South of[ the] Border. And when it comes to dinner buffets, we pull out all the stops! Just to name a few, you can choose from the Southern Hospitality Buffet, featuring BBQ Ribs, Southern Friend Chicken and Cajun Potato Salad; the Land and Sea Buffet, including Prime Rib with Au Jus and Horseradish, and Honey Pecan Grilled Salmon;[ or] The Rodeo Buffet, showcasing Chipotle Roasted Pork Loin and Slow-Braised BBQ Brisket. Vegetarian options are also available, as well as a variety of a la carte selections.
