She has taught the French Language continuously for decades and has been in Seattle teaching French for[ High]line Community College for the past for 11 years. She will be offering a 5 week course in the French Language[ at] WSPA that will be held before her Ballet Class. Sylvie is[ comfortable] teaching a multi- level class with beginners and those experienced in the French Language. She creates a warm and encouraging environment for learning and teens and adults are invited to join in this workshop. We warmly welcome Sylvie to our Faculty.
